# Proxy Configuration File
# Format: IP:PORT:USERNAME:PASSWORD (one proxy per line)
# Lines starting with # are ignored (comments)
# 
# Example:
# 12.34.56.78:8080:myuser:mypass
# 98.76.54.32:3128:anotheruser:anotherpass
#
# To use proxies:
# 1. Copy this file to proxies.json (same directory)
# 2. Add your proxies (one per line)
# 3. The bot will automatically rotate through them
#
# Without username/password (if proxy doesn't require auth):
# 12.34.56.78:8080::
